# Python 3.9 dev/test tooling for the ci.yml python job.
# Locked output: ci-dev-py39.txt. Refresh via scripts/update-lockfiles.sh.
#
# Separate from ci-dev-py3 because a lock is resolved against one interpreter
# version: 3.9 is at the end of its life and several projects have stopped
# shipping cp39 wheels, so the two resolutions genuinely differ.
maturin
# pytest 9.x requires Python 3.10, so this row resolves 8.4.2 either way; the
# bound makes that explicit. The suite uses fixtures and parametrize, so it
# cannot run pytest-free like the family's simpler bindings;
# GHSA-6w46-j5rx-g56g (pytest < 9.0.3) is acknowledged in osv-scanner.toml.
pytest<9
